<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's ANZ, Postbank cut one, three yr fixed rates.</title>
<headline>NZ's ANZ, Postbank cut one, three yr fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ and Postbank on Friday cut their one-year fixed mortgage interest rate to 10.25 percent from 10.50 percent.</p>
<p>The banks also cut their three-year fixed rate to 9.50 percent from 9.90 percent. The rates apply to new applications received from October 25.</p>
<p>The variable rate remains at 11.50 percent.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
